            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Controller 1.0.51 (94)

- On Mac, chat images open in the native Quick Look panel alongside neighboring images in the same message or attachment row.
- On Mac and iOS, remote file links in replies download directly into Quick Look with inline progress under the clicked link and offline cache reuse until the chat settles.
- Fixes a Mac crash when opening the sidebar environment menu and improves Mac crash reporting for AppKit layout and constraint exceptions.
- Fixes an iPhone crash when opening a chat while the Settled or Usage sheet is closing, and releases background chat timelines cleanly when switching chats on iPhone.
- Fast worktree copies clean up discarded checkouts in a background helper process and handle nested Git folders and ignored build files more reliably.
]]></description>
