        <item>
            <title>1.0.51</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:48:10 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/mweinbach/Controller</link>
            <sparkle:version>93</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.51</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Controller 1.0.51 (93)

- Long replies on iPhone and iPad keep appearing while more text arrives. Completed messages display their final Markdown formatting.
- On Mac and iOS, the composer keeps your highlighted command or file selected when new results arrive. Return and Tab accept the item you chose.
- Plans and expanded reasoning keep their last word visible between updates. Corrected text appears immediately, and new text fades in reading order.
- On Mac, code continues fading in after a streaming pause. Updates to long paragraphs spend less time on the main thread.
- Factory Droid keeps its session settings when a Mission sends a partial update after approval.
]]></description>
